    "accessibility": {
      "short": "A person in a white off-the-shoulder dress with blue trim and a black choker sits facing a mirror; nearby are flowers and a glass jar on a shelf, all painted with loose, visible brushstrokes.",
      "long": "The painting shows a figure from behind, seated and turned slightly toward a tall, narrow mirror on the left. The figure wears a white dress with thin blue trim at the neckline and sleeves, and a black choker. Their hair is light-colored and gathered up. To the right of the figure, a small shelf holds white flowers, a transparent glass jar with a lidded top and pink stopper, and another dark object. The background is composed of broad, textured brushstrokes in muted tones—grays, whites, pale blues, with sparse accents of red and green—evoking an undefined interior space. The entire surface shows evidence of impasto technique, with thick, directional paint application.",
